id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41611::$$$message_0316_0000_0000$$$::"Check it out![wvl canskip=0 time=400] More characters without screen time!"::
41612::$$$message_0316_0001_0000$$$::"Perseus the Hero (left),[br]Ryudou's dad (center),[br]and Gotou (right)."::
41613::$$$message_0316_0002_0000$$$::"Ooh, Gotou... You had thick eyebrows, huh?"::
41614::$$$message_0316_0003_0000$$$::"Perseus is one of the greatest heroes of Greek mythology, born to Zeus and Danaë, daughter of the King of Argos."::
41615::$$$message_0316_0004_0000$$$::"Yeah. He's Heracles's half-brother, and grew up to be a kindly old grandpa, apparently. [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01l(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01l(中)]It might've been the biggest mess that philandering king of the gods ever made."::
41616::$$$message_0316_0005_0000$$$::"It was that complicated? [br][cacheimage storage=セイバー巫女服01e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー巫女服01e(中)] Still, I have mixed feelings knowing he slew Medusa..."::
41617::$$$message_0316_0006_0000$$$::"By the way, does Issei's father have a name yet?"::
41618::$$$message_0316_0007_0000$$$::"If his name does come out, it'll be when old Raiga Fujimura takes center stage."::
�